        <h2>The Technical Realities of EV Charging in Established Klahanie Subdivisions</h2>
        <p>
          Residential electric vehicle supply equipment operates under intense electrical parameters. In an established community like Klahanie, where homes are thirty to forty years old, installing high-draw EVSE requires a meticulous assessment of the entire electrical distribution chain. Unlike an electric range that operates for forty minutes during dinner preparation, an EVSE pulls continuous current through conductors and bus bar stabs for six to ten hours uninterrupted.
        </p>

        <figure class="seo-location-figure" style="margin-block: 2.25rem; text-align: center;">
